    <categoryEntry name="Faction: Gue&apos;vesa" id="24c6-be1e-af0d-30fd" hidden="false"/>
    <categoryEntry name="Ke&apos;lshan Sept" id="5a50-8ff7-fba5-2d6e" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Focused in the T&apos;au&apos;va" id="360f-7055-e93d-8d1e" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a melee attack is allocated to a model with this tenet, substract 2 from that attack Armour Penetration characteristic. (AP -2 --&gt; AP 0)
- T&apos;AU EMPIRE INFANTRY models with this tenet can move and shoot Heavy Weapons without penalty to the hit roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </categoryEntry>
    <categoryEntry name="Faction: Kroot" id="2d20-c12b-e8b0-b738" hidden="false">
      <rules>
        <rule name="Kroot gene adaptation" id="7347-a597-8014-9c0b" hidden="false">
          <description>Each time an enemy unit is destroyed by a Kroot unit that is within 12&quot; of a Kroot Shaper, this gains a trait depending the Faction the original unit was (the traits can only be obtained once):

- Imperium, Adeptus Custodes: Each time a model with this rule would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 6+ that wound is not lost.
- Imperium, Sisters of Silence: Once per turn, this unit can do a Deny the Witch test as if it were a Psyker.
- Imperium, Adeptus Astartes: Add 1 to the Wounds characteristic of the models in this unit.
- Imperium/Gue&apos;vesa: Add 1 to the Leadership characteristic of the models this unit.
- Asuryani: Substract 1 of hit rolls against models in this unit.
- Orks: Add 1 to the Thoughness characteristic of the models in this unit.
- Tyranids: Add 1 to the Strength characteristic of the models in this unit.
- Chaos, Heretic Astartes: Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the models in this unit.

T&apos;au Empire, Bentu&apos;sin/Leagues of Votann, Nicassar, Vespid, Kroot or Necron factions does not provide a trait.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </categoryEntry>
    <categoryEntry name="Faction: Nicassar" id="a2d0-b408-a06e-8dc8" hidden="false">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="ba51-8872-e127-a48e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Nicassar Auxiliaries" id="4530-3899-2b86-e998" hidden="false">
          <description>NICASSAR CHARACTER units cannot be WARLORD or receive a WARLORD trait or EXPERIMENTAL SYSTEM.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </categoryEntry>
