    <profile name="Photon Grenades" id="8705-54fb-15f7-cc94" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">12</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Grenade D6</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="59b1-319e-ec13-d466">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="75aa-a838-b675-6484">-</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">-</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">If a successful hit is made for an attack made with this weapon against a target without the INORGANIC, VEHICLE or TITANIC keywords, that unit must subtract 1 from any hit rolls made by that unit.
In addition, if a wound is scored against a target without the INORGANIC, VEHICLE or TITANIC keywords, then until the start of your next Shooting phase, halve the Move characteristic of models in the target unit and subtract 2 from Advance rolls and charge rolls made for that unit.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Twin Ion Rifle (Overcharge)" id="2939-cf79-91a9-1533" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">30</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Heavy 6</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="59b1-319e-ec13-d466">8</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="75aa-a838-b675-6484">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time the bearer shoots with this weapon profile, if rolls any number of unmodified hit rolls of 1, the bearer suffers 1 mortal wound after shooting with this weapon. For each unmodified wound roll of 6 against a VEHICLE, it suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Twin Ion Rifle (Standard)" id="c1cb-ca5b-b705-f4b1" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">30</characteristic>
