    <profile name="Stealthy Hunters" id="81a4-8fdb-8a71-1a27" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a ranged attack is allocated to a model in this unit while it is receiving the benefits of cover, add an additional 1 to any armour saving throw made against that attack.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Walking Battleship" id="a6bc-fcec-b3f5-d5c5" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This model is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back. Each time this model makes a Normal Move, Advances or Fells Back, it can be moved across other models (excluding MONSTER and VEHICLE models) as if they were not there.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Master of War [Aura]" id="661e-c6b3-0d99-a7a4" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly T&apos;AU EMPIRE CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this unit&apos;s COMMANDER model, each time a CORE model in this unit makes an attack, re-roll a hit-roll of 1.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Tactical Acumen" id="7b64-91d0-528c-8c57" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command Phase, you can select one firendly SEPT BATTLESUIT unit within 9&quot; of this unit&apos;s COMMANDER model. Until the end of the turn:

- That unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge with in a turn in which it Fell Back.
- Each time a CORE model in that unit makes a ranged attack, you can ignore any or all hit modifiers.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Photon Casters" id="ca7a-6b77-c693-108d" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this unit is declared as a target of a charge, subtract 2 from that charge&apos;s charge roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Mobile Defences" id="7177-ef7b-3738-e3e3" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Mobile Defences : At the start of your Movement phase, if one unit from your army, excluding DRONE units, is embarked within a TIDEWALL TRANSPORT. TIDEWALL can make a Normal Move as if it had a Move characteristic of 8&quot; and had the FLY keyword.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="[Set-Up]" id="dea3-10e5-c479-9b09" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">TIDEWALL terrain features can be set up within 3&quot; of other friendly TIDEWALL terrain features.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Tidewall" id="9225-435a-c75d-59e8" hidden="false" typeId="b3a8-0452-7436-44d1" typeName="Transport">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">This model can transport any number of T&apos;AU EMPIRE INFANTRY CHARACTERS and one other T&apos;AU EMPIRE INFANTRY unit, but no more than 10 models in total. Each model with a wounds characteristic of 3 or more takes up the space of 2 models.</characteristic>
