                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a unit with this tenet is selected to shoot or fight, you can re-roll one hit roll and one wound roll when resolving that unit&apos;s attacks.
- Add 3&quot; to the range of aura abilities of models with this tenet.
- Each time a model with this tenet uses an ability that specifies a range, add 3&quot; to the range of that ability (to a maximum of 12&quot;).</characteristic>
