                        <profile name="Strike Swiftly" id="5a53-fc82-809e-b627" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the first battle round, before the first turn begins, INFANTRY units with this tenet that start the battle wholly within your deployment zone can make a Normal Move of up to 6&quot;. They cannot end this move within 9&quot; of the enemy deployment zone or any enemy models. If both players have units that can do this, the player who is taking the first turn moves their units first. In addition, after the first turn begins, when a INFANTRY unit is deployed on the Battlefield, it can move up to 3&quot;, but can&apos;t finish that movement within engagement range of enemy units.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Play Their Part" id="5ac3-b4a4-82cc-da42" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="60a3-6901-a903-9481" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Play Their Part" id="dd72-5607-5c0d-046a" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Units with this tennet without ETHEREAL Keyword gain the SACRIFICABLE trait. 
- Units with this tennet can make Heroic Interventions as they were a CHARACTER.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Adherents to the Teachings" id="b6cb-da3e-7632-874b" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="3cec-90d1-a4d2-65a5" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Adherents to the Teachings" id="575a-d5b1-bed4-7ad0" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 3&quot; to the range of aura abilities of models with this tenet (to a maximum of 12&quot;).
- Each time a model with this tenet uses an ability in your Command phase that specifies a range, add 3&quot; to the range of that or ability (to a maximum of 12&quot;).</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Calm Under Pressure" id="f939-ce42-c71a-f972" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="b08b-af2c-824b-4e4a" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Calm Under Pressure" id="0220-8836-c66d-953a" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- T&apos;AU EMPIRE INFANTRY models with this tenet can move and shoot Heavy Weapons without penalty to the hit roll.
- T&apos;AU EMPIRE models with this tenet add 1 to their Armour saving throws against Melee attacks.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                  </selectionEntries>
                </selectionEntryGroup>
              </selectionEntryGroups>
            </selectionEntryGroup>
            <selectionEntryGroup name="Option 1" id="2279-7d51-4afa-8f72" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
                  <conditionGroups>
                    <conditionGroup type="or">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition childId="da55-7ac5-ca77-d3b1" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="greaterThan" value="0"/>
                      </conditions>
                    </conditionGroup>
                  </conditionGroups>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <selectionEntryGroups>
                <selectionEntryGroup name="Sector B" id="8bc7-5954-be7a-0482" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="67da-c3a5-2f21-5be4" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <selectionEntries>
                    <selectionEntry name="Camouflage Experts" id="9c3d-ecdc-aa3d-9b41" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="1422-7772-7e9d-aa86" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Camouflage Experts" id="9b4d-0c56-e78a-ed7c" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a ranged attack is made against an INFANTRY unit with this tenet that is within a terrain feature, if the attacker is more than 12&quot; away, then the unit with this tenet is treated as having the benefits of Light and Dense Cover against that attack.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Defensive Doctrines" id="eb86-57da-8592-05ae" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="3d9b-7997-de85-e54a" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Defensive Doctrines" id="1efe-6240-87a5-43f7" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a melee attack with an Armour Penetration characteristic of -1 or -2 is allocated to a model with this tenet, if that model was charged this turn, that attack has an Armour Penetration characteristic of 0 instead.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Blocking Tactics" id="f822-08ff-9905-0c00" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="a623-903a-2624-4ff7" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Blocking Tactics" id="8093-9e30-2454-3810" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a CORE unit with this tenet makes a charge move, until the start of your next Charge phase, that unit have the Objective Secured ability. If such a unit already has this ability, each model counts as having an additional Wound when determining control of an objective marker.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Fire Caste Marksmen" id="d292-4bff-75a8-60a9" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="30d1-04fc-b51a-b186" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Fire Caste Marksmen" id="ad54-9bb1-f8c8-74da" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model with this tenet, without BATTLESUIT, DRONE or VEHICLE Keywords, makes a ranged attack, you can ignore any or all modifiers to the hit roll.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                  </selectionEntries>
                </selectionEntryGroup>
                <selectionEntryGroup name="Sector C" id="f96a-488d-87cb-a732" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="5759-7c24-9c38-3351" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <selectionEntries>
                    <selectionEntry name="Evasion Manoeuvres" id="5b40-a222-be0d-37ed" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="f64e-8f0a-3b04-0eac" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Evasion Manoeuvres" id="f4e2-37d9-47d3-a47b" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a unit that can FLY with this tenet Advances, until the start of your next Movement phase, it gains the Hard to hit ability.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Pinpoint Targeting" id="cf7e-13b0-a3b9-b12b" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="8c36-ab5c-3d45-77fc" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Pinpoint Targeting" id="1265-1cbd-91ad-41e1" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time model with this tenet makes a ranged attack that targets a unit within 12&quot;, the target does not receive the benefits of Light Cover against that attack.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Disengagement Protocols" id="216a-e775-ec9a-95f0" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="7d30-188d-8fb7-0a09" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Disengagement Protocols" id="846d-b2d3-457d-263a" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an INFANTRY unit with this tenet is selected to Fall Back, select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of that INFANTRY unit and, before disengaging, make attacks with the disengaging unit against the selected enemy unit as if it were your shooting phase.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                    <selectionEntry name="Fire Saturation" id="7561-0d26-440d-5e7b" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                      <constraints>
                        <constraint id="1a47-4d95-39b5-48b1" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                      </constraints>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                      </costs>
                      <profiles>
                        <profile name="Fire Saturation" id="6738-5be1-3715-766e" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model with this tenet makes a ranged attack with a Pulse weapon that targets a unit within 12&quot;, add 1 to that attack&apos;s hit roll.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
                        </profile>
                      </profiles>
                    </selectionEntry>
                  </selectionEntries>
                </selectionEntryGroup>
              </selectionEntryGroups>
