                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model with this tenet makes a ranged attack with a plasma weapon, an unmodified wound roll of 6 inflicts the weapon&apos;s Damage characteristic as mortal wounds on the target and the attack sequence ends.</characteristic>
