              <profiles>
                <profile name="2/1CP Drop threat acquisition" id="f879-e90c-3e6b-2f58" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">T’au Empire
Use this Stratagem in your Movement phase, when a BATTLESUITS unit from your army is set up on the battlefield as reinforcements. Until the end of the turn, each time a BATTLESUIT model in that unit makes a ranged attack, you can re-roll the hit roll. If that unit contains 4 or more BATTLESUIT models, this Stratagem-costs 2CP; otherwise, it costs 1CP.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="2/1CP Drop zone clear" id="83cd-d77a-6cca-a28a" collective="false" hidden="true" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <comment>Enclaves</comment>
              <constraints>
