                <profile name="1CP Saviour protocols" id="7601-f64b-0307-8d6b" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">T’au Empire
Use this Stratagem in any phase, when a saving throw is failed for a model in a SEPT unit from your army. Select one friendly SEPT DRONE model within 3&quot; of that unit, or within 6&quot; of that unit if it contains a model equipped with a drone controller. That DRONE model is destroyed and the Damage characteristic of that attack is changed to 0.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
