        <profile name="AX0 Manta" id="899b-76df-4470-9433" hidden="false" typeId="b3a8-0452-7436-44d1" typeName="Transport">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">This model has a transport capacity as follows:
- 200 SEPT INFANTRY, SEPT DRONE, AUXILIARY INFANTRY or AUXILIARY DRONES models.
- 4 SEPT DEVILFISH, SEPT SKY RAY GUNSHIP or SEPT HAMMERHEAD models.
- 8 BATTLESUIT models with a Wounds characteristic of 9 or less.

Any models embarked within another model when it embarks upon this model do not count towards this model&apos;s transport capacity. While a model is embarked upon this model, models embarked within that other model may not disembark. Models may not disembark from a model in a turn in which it disembarks from this model.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
