            <profile name="Target Sighted" id="8014-784a-91bd-3d40" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Shooting phase, select one enemy unit within 36&quot; and visible to this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time an SEPT INFANTRY CORE model, excluding BATTLESUIT models, makes a ranged attack against that unit, re-roll a wound roll of 1.</characteristic>
