          <profiles>
            <profile name="Technical Proficiency" id="8bc1-6f98-5826-40d7" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Movement phase, this unit can do either twice one of the following protocols, or each one once:
- Repair Protocol: This model can repair one friendly VEHICLE or BATTLESUIT model within 3&quot; of it. That VEHICLE or BATTLESUIT model regains up to 1D6 lost wounds. Each model can only be repaired once per turn.
- Stabilization Protocol: This model can bring back one friendly destroyed VEHICLE or BATTLESUIT model from a unit 3&quot; of it. That VEHICLE or BATTLESUIT model is set up in coherency with the unit, with up to 4 wounds remaining. Each unit can be affected once by Stabilization Protocol per turn.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Earth Caste Combat Engineer" id="bdd5-3b1a-764d-46f3" hidden="false" typeId="800f-21d0-4387-c943" typeName="Model">
