          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When a unit is set up on the battlefield, each accompanying DRONE units are set up in unit coherency with it. From that point onwards, each DRONE unit is treated as a separate unit.</characteristic>
