              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This unit cannot be selected as a target for ranged attacks unless it is the closest eligible target to the firing model or is within 12&quot; of the firing model. In your Movement phase, if this unit does not Remain Stationary, it loses this ability until the start of your next Movement phase.</characteristic>
