                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an attack made with the Dawn Blade is allocated to a model, that model cannot use any rules to ignore the wounds it loses.
In addition, at the end of each Fight phase, if any number of enemy models were slain by this weapon, the bearer regains 1 Wound.</characteristic>
