            <profile name="Defender of the Greater Good" id="219b-ddb0-d424-9f5f" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly T&apos;AU EMPIRE CORE or T&apos;AU EMPIRE CHARACTER unit within 6&quot; of this unit&apos;s COMMANDER model. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a CORE or CHARACTER model in that unit makes an attack, you can re-roll the hit roll.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Hero of the Empire " id="0847-5e89-dc70-8156" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If your army is Battle-forged, this units COMMANDER model must be your army&apos;s WARLORD. If more than one model in your army has a rule to this effect, then one of those models must be your army&apos;s WARLORD.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
