          <profiles>
            <profile name="Multi-function Surveyor" id="c030-ee14-3f28-1bb3" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Movement phase, select one of the following protocols for each model of the unit to perform:
- Repair Protocol: This model can repair one friendly VEHICLE or BATTLESUIT model within 3&quot; of it. That VEHICLE or BATTLESUIT model regains up to D3 lost wounds. Each model can only be repaired once per turn.
- Surveillance Protocol: Select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit. Until the end of the turn, that enemy unit does not receive the benefits of Light Cover, Heavy Cover and Dense Cover.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
