              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Movement phase, select one enemy unit within 12&quot; of the bearer and roll 3D6, if the result is greater than the enemy unit&apos;s Leadership characteristic, select one of the results below to take effect until the start of your next Movement phase.

