                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- In your Command phase, if the bearer is on the battlefield, it can intone one additional invocation it knows from the Invocations of the Ethereals that has not already been intoned by a friendly model that turn.
