    <selectionEntryGroup name="Invocations of the Ethereals" id="781c-f068-0343-beb8" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true">
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="1. Storm of Fire" id="f573-b408-68e6-a807" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="f8ed-23b8-87a1-7c83" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
            <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
            <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
            <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
          </costs>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Storm of Fire" id="17be-be22-1f63-11ff" hidden="false" typeId="0c29-9351-f423-99b3" typeName="Invocations">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="-" typeId="d873-0959-8f8c-93ce">If this invocation is inspiring, select up to 3 friendly T&apos;AU EMPIRE CORE or T&apos;AU EMPIRE CHARACTER unit (excluding VEHICLE and FARSIGHT ENCLAVES units) to Inspire.
Until the ETHEREAL inspires another unit with this teaching, the Inspired unit can make ranged attacks without any action it is performing failing.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="2. Sense of Stone" id="ce45-d557-827a-9ca1" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="c52a-2bec-61cb-c529" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
            <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
            <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
            <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
          </costs>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Sense of Stone" id="931c-fd66-e81c-1e4f" hidden="false" typeId="0c29-9351-f423-99b3" typeName="Invocations">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="-" typeId="d873-0959-8f8c-93ce">If this invocation is inspiring, select up to 3 friendly T&apos;AU EMPIRE CORE or T&apos;AU EMPIRE CHARACTER unit (excluding VEHICLE and FARSIGHT ENCLAVES units) to Inspire.
Until the ETHEREAL inspires another unit with this teaching, each time a model without DRONE Keyword in the Inspired unit would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.
In case of having a similar ability, add 1 to said roll.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="3. Zephyr&apos;s Grace" id="eed0-c364-8937-b14f" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="d727-4dbd-5e9e-917c" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
            <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
            <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
            <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
          </costs>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Zephyr&apos;s Grace" id="fb2e-a81e-c0c6-b2e0" hidden="false" typeId="0c29-9351-f423-99b3" typeName="Invocations">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="-" typeId="d873-0959-8f8c-93ce">If this invocation is inspiring, select up to 3 friendly T&apos;AU EMPIRE CORE or T&apos;AU EMPIRE CHARACTER unit (excluding VEHICLE and FARSIGHT ENCLAVES units) to Inspire.
During the next Shooting phase the Inspired unit can move up to 6&quot; in that phase, either before or after it shoots, as if it were the Movement phase.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="4. Power of Tides" id="e994-0cf5-50da-8865" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="8e84-c1f9-cf74-7570" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
            <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
            <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
            <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
          </costs>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Power of Tides" id="96ab-ac34-0030-e9f2" hidden="false" typeId="0c29-9351-f423-99b3" typeName="Invocations">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="-" typeId="d873-0959-8f8c-93ce">If this invocation is inspiring, select up to 3 friendly T&apos;AU EMPIRE CORE or T&apos;AU EMPIRE CHARACTER unit (excluding VEHICLE and FARSIGHT ENCLAVES units) to Inspire.
Until the ETHEREAL inspires another unit with this teaching, every model in the Inspired unit is considered to be in a Defensible terrain feature.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="5. Unifying Mantra " id="2661-b17e-acbc-a525" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="3886-a197-2638-d355" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
            <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
            <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
            <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
          </costs>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Unifying Mantra" id="b7c7-3ac6-3816-3908" hidden="false" typeId="0c29-9351-f423-99b3" typeName="Invocations">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="-" typeId="d873-0959-8f8c-93ce">If this invocation is inspiring, select up to 3 friendly T&apos;AU EMPIRE CORE or T&apos;AU EMPIRE CHARACTER unit (excluding VEHICLE and FARSIGHT ENCLAVES units) to Inspire.
Until the ETHEREAL inspires another unit with this teaching, Morale tests made by the Inspired unit are automatically passed (do not roll any dice).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="6. Wisdom of the Guides" id="ea14-8b8f-00cc-968c" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="ccb4-1867-b67a-1d96" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
