                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly T&apos;AU AUXILIARY unit is within 6&quot; of this WARLORD, that unit is treated as not having the T&apos;AU AUXILIARY keyword for the purpose of the Markerlights rule.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
