                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly SA&apos;CEA unit within 9&quot; of thie WARLORD. Until the start of your next Command phase, that unit gains the Objective Secured ability. If that unit already has this ability, models in that unit count one aditional Wound as when determining control of an objective marker.</characteristic>
