                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Details: Blessing (Aura): Psychic Disruption Field has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, units at 6&quot; of the PSYKER cannot be affected by other psychic powers and lose any effect made by other active psychic powers until the start of your next Psychic phase.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
