                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">18</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Details: Malediction: Telekinesis has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select a enemy unit within 18&quot; of this PSYKER, the selected unit suffers D3 mortal wounds, and until the end of your next psychic phase, halve the movement characteristic, advance rolls and charge rolls of that unit.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
