                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">18</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Details: Malediction: Crush Armour has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, select a enemy unit within 18&quot; of this PSYKER, the selected unit, until the end of your next psychic phase, cannot be affected by Light or Heavy cover. Also it substracts 1 from each armour saving throw.</characteristic>
