                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">12</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Details: Blessing: Lighten has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, select a friendly unit at 12&quot; of the PSYKER. The unit affected by this power, until the end of your next psychic phase, ignores Difficult Ground, and when charging, roll 3D6 dice and discard the lowest result.</characteristic>
