                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Details: Blessing: Gravitational Barrier has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, select a friendly unit at 9&quot; of the PSYKER. Until the end of your next psychic phase, wound rolls of 1-3 for attacks with strength 5 or less made against the unit affected by this power fails irrespective of the abilities the weapon has.</characteristic>
